Once upon a time, a dog wandered through the village. 


It was a small dog, but it had big dreams. 

The dog always dreamed of becoming the fastest dog in the world. 
Every day, the dog would run through the streets, barking joyfully.
One day, the dog met another dog who was much faster.
The two dogs decided to race. The race was on!
The faster dog took the lead, but the small dog kept chasing. 
In the end, both dogs reached the finish line at almost the same time.
The crowd cheered for the two dogs, amazed by their determination. 
The two dogs became great friends and raced together every day.
